WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.730
You meant to ask how the surgery went.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.510
Then the week got away from you.

3
00:00:04.928 --> 00:00:06.958
Most friendships don't end.

4
00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:08.458
They just go quiet.

5
00:00:08.928 --> 00:00:11.438
And forgetting isn't the same as not caring.

6
00:00:12.628 --> 00:00:14.118
Meet Holdfast.

7
00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:17.758
A memory for the people you love, right inside Telegram.

8
00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:19.438
No new app to open.

9
00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:24.888
After you see someone, hold the button and talk for about twenty seconds.

10
00:00:25.548 --> 00:00:26.790
<v You>Coffee with Marco.

11
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.910
<v You>His mom's surgery is on the 14th.

12
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.790
<v You>He's stressed about the job hunt.

13
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.530
<v You>Oh, and I said I'd introduce him to a recruiter.

14
00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.567
Holdfast turns it into text and sorts it out.

15
00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:38.687
Who you saw.

16
00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:40.347
What's going on in their life.

17
00:00:40.737 --> 00:00:43.947
And the part that matters most: what you promised to do.

18
00:00:44.937 --> 00:00:49.147
Then it finds you at the right moment, like the day after the surgery.

19
00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:51.667
Three nudges a week, at most.

20
00:00:52.057 --> 00:00:54.447
Enough to help, never enough to nag.

21
00:00:55.202 --> 00:00:56.252
And the recording?

22
00:00:56.902 --> 00:00:58.852
Deleted as soon as the text is saved.

23
00:00:59.202 --> 00:01:01.272
We keep the words, never the audio.

24
00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:04.083
Say it out loud once.

25
00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:06.343
Holdfast remembers the rest.

26
00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:09.703
Join the waitlist at useholdfast.co.
